-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1dcd23ea-171b-437a-b21e-a31fbd2988ce\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6d57511f-0ebe-4e89-b21d-94be3525eca8\"><b>✔️ 일시</b></span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e36c0ea2-5dde-4c59-911f-0ffb3c947f18\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-39193b06-740c-4d43-a2c7-202cbcd0ff86\">- 8/22(토) 19:30 ~ 20:00 경</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ddf1a4fb-0a5e-4b41-ab83-f43a25a19d60\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-dc5bd014-c5fc-46d5-a2c7-63324d0dc836\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dda9df1c-ace0-4356-aecc-004c50b649ae\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a0dc7d7a-0f9d-4d32-a951-ad73a2f43f72\"><b>✔️ 내용</b></span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9eefe47c-c034-4493-a49a-00ec5eb0c406\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3abb5b0d-76cb-454b-8a3e-7d65e2865508\">1. 솔로 레이드 사치스러운 거미에서 발생한 특정 조건에서 간헐적으로 보호막이 제거되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2eed267e-a3a3-497e-82ef-84f651bcf154\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b799b1e9-362a-4bfd-9d55-b2672b66c271\">└ 지휘관님께서는 게임을 재실행하신 후, 솔로 레이드에 도전하여 주시기를 부탁드립니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-73547385-ad32-4df2-a189-68f6102c6aea\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b4be3df9-baa6-44e9-8c72-a9fd01cdef9b\">└ 불편을 드리게 된 점 깊이 사과드리며, 지휘관 여러분께 보상으로 (관리 키트 상자 II * 24, 큐브 배터리 무작위 보상 * 18)을 지급해 드립니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2480dab9-f749-4c36-b780-89cb97b7fdf9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9d00886b-84c4-4d23-813d-846e1e099c0a\">2. 스토리 이벤트 PERSONA ON FRONTLINE에서 스테이지 전투 중, 설정 - 전투의 [버스트 스킬 위치]를 [왼쪽]으로 설정한 경우 풀 버스트 게이지의 연출 방향이 의도와 다르게 표시되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-311f9e1e-213c-45ad-b886-1b0153e1e2ac\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5cda4ac2-60ba-4074-ac85-57570afb0613\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9b241882-f9df-4bf4-91df-8521481953ad\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-df700f48-441e-44bf-8160-355c44095395\">※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fff62e3d-cca9-45bf-8adf-58d4bf419c94\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e2a1b013-0fe0-4780-841a-e20fec06dcd8\">※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f71b08b9-110b-4778-8823-ca378bc66f94\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-655364b1-509a-4d18-8cc9-59b9ea2faeda\">·····················································································</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8b4dfbf1-4bda-43a4-be2d-6fea2e56b4c2\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9f510156-9a02-4dc8-ae6f-e8ec321f6dbf\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9e8f05ca-883b-4589-9be8-ab18a6fb81f9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-597297df-2b62-459a-b218-747675f3d264\">게임 이용에 불편을 드린 점 깊이 사과드립니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-2f56552e-c33f-4257-838e-bcb2f94c17ef\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-106abcf1-5f9c-4f5e-b452-8298462215d9\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:100px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-106abcf1-5f9c-4f5e-b452-8298462215d9\", \"src\" : \"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA4MjJfMjgy/MDAxNzg3Mzk1OTI4NDEw.ziDfJP_EniMqgNZnyVN0cwVUsx-8gR2gizb8QOLPyKEg.nv4wzMkCcXlK8AvIS6tncy9utP-wb7TLkSALQuFN3qMg.PNG/241030_%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8_100x100.png?type=w1678\", \"originalWidth\" : \"100\", \"originalHeight\" : \"100\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\", \"fileSize\": \"19573\" }'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA4MjJfMjgy/MDAxNzg3Mzk1OTI4NDEw.ziDfJP_EniMqgNZnyVN0cwVUsx-8gR2gizb8QOLPyKEg.nv4wzMkCcXlK8